  m_text: 'Bet ways win when matching symbols appear on adjacent reels from the leftmost
    to the rightmost.

    Only highest win per bet way is paid. All symbols pay
    as described in the paytable.

    Wins on different ways are added together
    and scatter wins (if available) are added to way wins.'
