  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The Free Games Bonus Feature is only started by the U-SPIN Wheel Bonus
    Feature. 12 free games are awarded. All free games are played with the same bet
    levels that where in play when the free games were started. During the Free Games
    Bonus Feature, all pays are doubled, Additional free games may be awarded during
    the Free Games Bonus Feature and are added to the remaining free games. Money
    Bag Bonus Feature is available during free games. U-Spin Wheel Bonus Feature
    is available during free games, The Free Games Bonus Feature ends when no free
    gmaes remain or when 60 free games have been played.
