      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "3 scattered\ton reeels 1, 3 and 5 stars\nthe U-Spin Wheel Bonus Feature,
    One spin of the wheel is awarded.\nTouching anywhere on the screen spins the
    Wheel. the\t      wheel bonus awards are Credits or Free Games.\nIf the wheels
    stops on a Credit Award, the indicated credit amount is awarded and the U-spin
    Wheels Bonus Feature ends. if the wheel stops on a Free Games, 1x the total credits
    bet is awarded and the Free Games Bonus Feature is started.\nThe manner in which
    the player spins the wheel has no affect on the outcome of the U-Spin Wheel Bonus
    Feature.\n\tappears on reels 1, 3 and 5 only."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
