  m_text: "3 scattered\ton reels 2, 3 and 4 starts the Money Bag Bonus Feature. Select
    1 of 3 \n\tto reveal its credit value. The 2 unpicked credit values are then
    revealed and the Money Bag Bonus Feature ends.\nMoney Bag Bonus Feature awards
    range from 3 to 50 credits times the total number of credits bet. Bonus awards
    shown have already been multiplied by the total credits bet.\n\tappears on reels
    2, 3 and 4 only."
